                  <SHORT-NAME>CsmAsymPrivateKeyExtractMaxKeySize</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">The maximum, in bytes, of all key length used in all CRY primitives which implement an asymmetrical private key extraction.</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
