                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">&#xD;
True: Need to use RTE interfaces&#xD;
False: No need to use RTE interfaces</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
